---
---
<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

    <div class="mb-16" data-animate>
      <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans block mb-8">/ THE VAULT</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-heading leading-tight mb-6">
        We Published Our Entire Playbook. We're Not Worried.
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-body text-lg max-w-2xl">
        <p>
          30 tools across four failure points. Everything an operator needs to find and fix the place their marketing breaks down.
        </p>
        <p>
          Checklists, templates, worksheets — organized by problem, built for operators. The same tools we use with $3,500/month retainer clients.
        </p>
        <p class="text-subtle">
          Here's what we learned: the people who download this don't become competitors. They become clients. Because knowing what to fix and having time to fix it are two different things.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-border">

      <!-- Path 1: Know your problem -->
      <div class="bg-bg p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col" data-animate data-delay="0">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans mb-4">Know your problem already?</p>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading mb-4 leading-snug">Download the Full Toolkit</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed flex-1 mb-8">
          All 30 tools. All four failure points. Take what you need.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/toolkit"
          class="inline-block border border-accent text-accent font-sans font-medium px-6 py-3 text-sm hover:bg-accent hover:text-bg transition-colors duration-200 w-fit"
        >
          Download Free Toolkit →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 2: Not sure -->
      <div class="bg-bg p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans mb-4">Not sure where you're leaking?</p>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading mb-4 leading-snug">Take the Diagnostic First</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed flex-1 mb-8">
          We'll identify your specific failure point and deliver just the tools that apply — pre-sorted, ready to use. You don't have to figure out which folder to open.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/diagnostic/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-accent text-bg font-sans font-medium px-6 py-3 text-sm hover:bg-heading transition-colors duration-200 w-fit"
        >
          Find My Profit Leak →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="text-muted text-sm italic mt-6 text-center" data-animate data-delay="0.2">
      Most operators download the toolkit and take the diagnostic anyway. The diagnostic tells you which folder to open first.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
